{"id":62825,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-10-19T12:21:47","modified_gmt":"2026-10-19T11:21:47","slug":"sabrosa-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sabrosa-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Sabrosa Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Sabrosa Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Sabrosa Trail 2026<\/strong> (5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do <strong>Sabrosa Trail por Terras de Magalh\u00e3es<\/strong>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, na vila e concelho de <strong>Sabrosa<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Vila Real<\/strong>, em pleno cora\u00e7\u00e3o do Alto Douro Vinhateiro.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida e chegada no <strong>Parque B.B. King<\/strong> (junto \u00e0 Exposi\u00e7\u00e3o Permanente Fern\u00e3o Magalh\u00e3es), os percursos atravessam vinhas de socalcos, caminhos rurais e aldeias vinhateiras hist\u00f3ricas como Vilarinho de S\u00e3o Rom\u00e3o, Celeir\u00f3s, Provesende, S\u00e3o Martinho de Anta, Pa\u00e7os e o Castro de Sabrosa. O evento compreende quatro provas: <strong>ST36K \u2013 Trail Longo<\/strong> (36,4 km com 1430m D+, ATRP Grau 2), <strong>ST19K \u2013 Trail Curto<\/strong> (19,1 km com 780m D+, ATRP Grau 2), <strong>ST10K \u2013 Mini Trail<\/strong> (9,8 km com 465m D+, ATRP Grau 3) e <strong>Caminhada 10K<\/strong> (9,8 km com 465m D+).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado conjuntamente pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Sabrosa<\/strong> e pela <strong>PORTUGALNTN, Lda.<\/strong>, o evento \u00e9 certificado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Trail Running de Portugal (ATRP)<\/strong> e inclui no valor da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o de todas as provas t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, pr\u00e9mio finisher nos trails, banhos quentes na Piscina Municipal Rosa Mota e almo\u00e7o volante completo no Centro Escolar Fern\u00e3o Magalh\u00e3es. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; backgroun