, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase (25\/09 a 30\/10):<\/strong> 16,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase (31\/10 a 11\/11):<\/strong> 18,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 11\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">ST10K (Mini Trail)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 22 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:15 \u2022 465m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase (25\/09 a 30\/10):<\/strong> 13,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase (31\/10 a 11\/11):<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 11\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 10K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 22 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30 \u2022 465m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o \u00danico (25\/09 a 11\/11):<\/strong> 12,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 11\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Sabrosa Trail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Sabrosa Trail por Terras de Magalh\u00e3es realiza-se no domingo, 22 de novembro de 2026, com partida e chegada no Parque B.B. King (junto \u00e0 Exposi\u00e7\u00e3o Permanente Fern\u00e3o Magalh\u00e3es), em Sabrosa, distrito de Vila Real.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida, dist\u00e2ncias e tempos limite?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No domingo, 22 de novembro: ST36K (36,4 km, 1430m D+, limite 6h00 com barreira \u00e0s 3h20 em Provesende aos 21,2 km) parte \u00e0s 07:30; ST19K (19,1 km, 780m D+, limite 4h00 com barreira \u00e0s 2h30 aos 12,8 km) parte \u00e0s 09:00; ST10K (9,8 km, 465m D+, limite 2h30 com barreira a 1h30 aos 6,5 km) parte \u00e0s 09:15; e a Caminhada 10K (9,8 km) parte \u00e0s 09:30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os, fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 11 de novembro de 2026 em duas fases (at\u00e9 30\/10 e de 31\/10 a 11\/11): ST36K (18,00 \u20ac \/ 20,00 \u20ac), ST19K (16,00 \u20ac \/ 18,00 \u20ac), ST10K (13,00 \u20ac \/ 15,00 \u20ac) e Caminhada 10K (12,00 \u20ac). Todas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, abastecimentos, seguro, banho quente e almo\u00e7o volante completo (2 sandes de porco no espeto, sopa de legumes, fruta e bebidas). Nas equipas, por cada 7 inscritos, 1 inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 oferta.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido no Controlo Zero?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Nas provas de Trail Longo (ST36K), Trail Curto (ST19K) e Mini Trail (ST10K) \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio apresentar no Controlo Zero: recipiente para transporte de \u00e1gua (camelbak, bid\u00e3o ou garrafa, al\u00e9m de copo para abastecimentos em semi-autossufici\u00eancia), telem\u00f3vel operacional e apito. No ST36K e ST19K \u00e9 tamb\u00e9m obrigat\u00f3ria a manta t\u00e9rmica.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o evento e onde funcionam o secretariado, banhos e almo\u00e7o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela C\u00e2mara Municipal de Sabrosa e pela PORTUGALNTN, Lda., com certifica\u00e7\u00e3o ATRP. O secretariado funciona na Exposi\u00e7\u00e3o Permanente Fern\u00e3o Magalh\u00e3es no s\u00e1bado (21\/11, das 15:00 \u00e0s 18:00) e no domingo (22\/11, das 06:30 \u00e0s 09:00). Os banhos quentes decorrem na Piscina Municipal Rosa Mota e o almo\u00e7o volante e entrega de pr\u00e9mios realizam-se a partir das 12:00 no Centro Escolar Fern\u00e3o Magalh\u00e3es.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Sabrosa Trail 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Parque B.B. King (junto \u00e0 Exposi\u00e7\u00e3o Permanente Fern\u00e3o Magalh\u00e3es), Sabrosa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Sabrosa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Vila Real\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"C\u00e2mara Municipal de Sabrosa \/ PORTUGALNTN, Lda.\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Sabrosa Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Sabrosa Trail por Terras de Magalh\u00e3es realiza-se no domingo, 22 de novembro de 2026, com partida e chegada no Parque B.B. King (junto \u00e0 Exposi\u00e7\u00e3o Permanente Fern\u00e3o Magalh\u00e3es), em Sabrosa, distrito de Vila Real.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida, dist\u00e2ncias e tempos limite?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No domingo, 22 de novembro: ST36K (36,4 km, 1430m D+, limite 6h00 com barreira \u00e0s 3h20 em Provesende aos 21,2 km) parte \u00e0s 07:30; ST19K (19,1 km, 780m D+, limite 4h00 com barreira \u00e0s 2h30 aos 12,8 km) parte \u00e0s 09:00; ST10K (9,8 km, 465m D+, limite 2h30 com barreira a 1h30 aos 6,5 km) parte \u00e0s 09:15; e a Caminhada 10K (9,8 km) parte \u00e0s 09:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os, fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 11 de novembro de 2026 em duas fases (at\u00e9 30\/10 e de 31\/10 a 11\/11): ST36K (18,00 \u20ac \/ 20,00 \u20ac), ST19K (16,00 \u20ac \/ 18,00 \u20ac), ST10K (13,00 \u20ac \/ 15,00 \u20ac) e Caminhada 10K (12,00 \u20ac). Todas as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es incluem t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, abastecimentos, seguro, banho quente e almo\u00e7o volante completo (2 sandes de porco no espeto, sopa de legumes, fruta e bebidas). Nas equipas, por cada 7 inscritos, 1 inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 oferta.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido no Controlo Zero?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Nas provas de Trail Longo (ST36K), Trail Curto (ST19K) e Mini Trail (ST10K) \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio apresentar no Controlo Zero: recipiente para transporte de \u00e1gua (camelbak, bid\u00e3o ou garrafa, al\u00e9m de copo para abastecimentos em semi-autossufici\u00eancia), telem\u00f3vel operacional e apito. No ST36K e ST19K \u00e9 tamb\u00e9m obrigat\u00f3ria a manta t\u00e9rmica.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza o evento e onde funcionam o secretariado, banhos e almo\u00e7o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova \u00e9 organizada pela C\u00e2mara Municipal de Sabrosa e pela PORTUGALNTN, Lda., com certifica\u00e7\u00e3o ATRP. O secretariado funciona na Exposi\u00e7\u00e3o Permanente Fern\u00e3o Magalh\u00e3es no s\u00e1bado (21\/11, das 15:00 \u00e0s 18:00) e no domingo (22\/11, das 06:30 \u00e0s 09:00). Os banhos quentes decorrem na Piscina Municipal Rosa Mota e o almo\u00e7o volante e entrega de pr\u00e9mios realizam-se a partir das 12:00 no Centro Escolar Fern\u00e3o Magalh\u00e3es.\"}}]}<\/s